{'symbol': 'DPZ', 'date': '2022-05-12 07:07:00', 'title': "DOMINO'S® AWARDS 'WORLD'S FASTEST PIZZA MAKER'", 'text': "PIZZA MAKERS FROM AROUND THE WORLD COMPETED FOR COVETED TITLE LAS VEGAS , MAY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINO'S PIZZA INC. (NYSE: DPZ), THE LARGEST PIZZA COMPANY IN THE WORLD, AWARDED THE 2022 WORLD'S FASTEST PIZZA MAKER TITLE TO ZAGROS JAFF AMONG NEARLY 8,000 CHEERING SPECTATORS AT THE VENETIAN RESORT IN LAS VEGAS ON MAY 10. JAFF, A REGIONAL MANAGER IN HAMPSHIRE, ENGLAND, MADE THREE LARGE PIZZAS IN AN IMPRESSIVE 70 SECONDS – THAT'S EQUAL TO MAKING EACH PIZZA IN ROUGHLY 23 SECONDS!"}